OL,3,GNEWSACould course upgrade bring the
OL,4,AOpen to Newcastle?
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoyal County Down Golf Club in
OL,7,FNewcastle has submitted a planning
OL,8,Fapplication for a major upgrade of its
OL,9,Fchampionship course.
OL,11,FThe work could help position the club
OL,12,Fto bid for the Open golf championship,
OL,13,Fwhich has previously been held at Royal
OL,14,FPortrush.
OL,16,FThe club is working with the same
OL,17,Fdesigners and planning consultants who
OL,18,Fworked with Royal Portrush ahead of The
OL,19,FOpen in 2019.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
