OL,3,GNEWSACould course upgrade bring the
OL,4,AOpen to Newcastle?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe plan includes new and revised tees,
OL,7,Fnew bunkers and reconfiguration of
OL,8,Ffairways on nine of the championship
OL,9,Fcourse holes.
